
>> q := { <- 9. } qala. 
Okuphumayo bhala: q, umugqa-omusha.
q := { :a <- a * a. } sebenzisa-ku: 6. 
Okuphumayo bhala: q, umugqa-omusha.
q := { :a :b <- (a + b). } sebenzisa-ku: 3 futhi: 4. 
Okuphumayo bhala: q, umugqa-omusha.
q := { :a :b :c <- (a + b + c). } sebenzisa-ku: 3 futhi: 4 futhi: 1. 
Okuphumayo bhala: q, umugqa-omusha.
